=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Windurst Waters (S)} for a cutscene.
** Although the goal is to assemble the {@k} {k:Gleipnir}, you never actually obtain it.
* You must now collect the following three key items in any order:
** Examine the **Gate of Darkness** in the {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins} (I-7, Rose Tower) [Map 4] for an {@k} {k:Irradiant strand}.
*** Survival Guide {z:Toraimarai Canal} would put you right next to {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins} zone.
** Check the **Fey Blossoms** at {z:Grauberg (S)} (F-5) for a cutscene
*** Check again and you will be asked for a {i:Bottled Pixie|Bottled Pixie|2525}
*** Obtain a {i:Bottled Pixie|Bottled Pixie|2525} and trade it to the **Fey Blossoms** in {z:Grauberg (S)} (F-5, between 18:00-6:00) to obtain a {@k} {k:Scintillant strand} from {n:Adrasteia}.
**** The {i:Bottled Pixie|Bottled Pixie|2525} is a guaranteed drop from {m:Yagudo High Priest} - right at the Survival Guide for {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)}, or just within {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} for additional spawn points.
**** You can get to the {p:Witchfire Glen} area either by traversing Grauberg directly, or more quickly by using a route through the Veridical Conflux through part of the {p:Walk of Echoes} that connects to near {k:Pashhow gate crystal} __if__ sufficient mission and {p:Jeuno Voidwatch Questline|Category:Voidwatch Quests} progress has been made - use the nearby Survival Guide or {s:Recall-Pashh}.
** Head to {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} and examine the **Writhing Flame** (G-7, ground floor, in the north hallway, head north from the large central room) for a cutscene.
*** Return to the **Writhing Flame** and trade it any {p:Job Testimony|Category:Job Testimony} for a {@k} {k:Refulgent strand}. Testimony does not have to match your job.
**** {i:Scholar's Testimony|Scholar's Testimony|2557} is a high drop rate from 3 of the 4 Orcs at I-11 west of the East Ronfaure [S] Survival Guide
*** **{c=red:Note: }**You will be unable to complete this miniquest on {p:GEO} or {p:RUN}.
* Speak to {n:Velda-Galda} at {z:Windurst Waters (S)} (K-9) three times.
** Each key item turn-in generates a separate cutscene.
* **Wait one game day** before speaking to {n:Velda-Galda} again for the final cutscene.

If you are working on missions then return to {M:Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time}.
